#: src/cipher.cpp:477
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Diffie-Hellman key exchange is not supported by your installation of the Qt "
"Cryptographic Architecture (QCA). You likely need to install an additional "
"provider plugin. Diffie-Hellman key exchange support is usually provided by "
"the qca-ossl plugin."
msgstr ""
"Vaša instalacija kriptografske arhitekture Qt (QCA) ne podržava razmjenu "
"ključeva Diffie–Hellman. Vjerojatno trebate instalirati dodatni dodatak "
"pružatelja. Podršku za razmjenu ključeva Diffie–Hellman obično pruža dodatak "
"qca-ossl."

#: src/cipher.cpp:490
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Blowfish in cipher-block chaining (CBC) mode is not supported by your "
"installation of the Qt Cryptographic Architecture (QCA). You likely need to "
"install an additional provider plugin for QCA. Blowfish support is usually "
"provided by the qca-ossl plugin."
msgstr ""
"Vaša instalacija kriptografske arhitekture Qt (QCA) ne podržava Blowfish u "
"načinu ulančavanja blokova šifre (CBC). Vjerojatno trebate instalirati "
"dodatni dodatak pružatelja za QCA. Podršku za Blowfish obično pruža dodatak "
"qca-ossl."

#: src/cipher.cpp:502
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Blowfish in electronic codebook (ECB) mode is not supported by your "
"installation of the Qt Cryptographic Architecture (QCA). You likely need to "
"install an additional provider plugin for QCA. Blowfish support is usually "
"provided by the qca-ossl plugin."
msgstr ""
"Vaša instalacija kriptografske arhitekture Qt (QCA) ne podržava Blowfish u "
"načinu elektroničke kodne knjige (ECB). Vjerojatno trebate instalirati "
"dodatni dodatak pružatelja za QCA. Podršku za Blowfish obično pruža dodatak "
"qca-ossl."

