"change these.</p><p>The <b>T</b>opic mode means that only the channel "
"operator can change the topic for the channel.</p></qt>"
msgstr "<qt><p>Ove mogućnosti određuju <em>način rada</em> kanala. Mijenjati ih može samo operator.</p><p>Način rada <b>T</b>eme znači da temu kanala može promijeniti samo operator kanala.</p></qt>"

#: src/viewer/channeloptionsdialog.cpp:611
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt><p>These control the <em>mode</em> of the channel.  Only an operator can "
"change these.</p><p><b>N</b>o messages from outside means users who are not "
"in the channel cannot send messages for everybody in the channel to see.  "
"Almost all channels have this set to prevent nuisance messages.</p></qt>"
msgstr "<qt><p>Ove mogućnosti određuju <em>način rada</em> kanala. Mijenjati ih može samo operator.</p><p>Način rada <b>bez poruka izvana</b> znači da korisnici koji nisu na kanalu ne mogu slati poruke koje bi vidjeli svi na kanalu. Gotovo svi kanali imaju uključenu ovu mogućnost kako bi se spriječile neželjene poruke.</p></qt>"

#: src/viewer/channeloptionsdialog.cpp:613
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt><p>These control the <em>mode</em> of the channel.  Only an operator can "
"change these.</p><p>A <b>S</b>ecret channel will not show up in the channel "
"list, nor will any user be able to see that you are in the channel with the "
"<em>WHOIS</em> command or anything similar.  Only the people that are in the "
"same channel will know that you are in this channel, if this mode is set.</"
"p></qt>"
msgstr "<qt><p>Ove mogućnosti određuju <em>način rada</em> kanala. Mijenjati ih može samo operator.</p><p><b>Tajni</b> kanal ne prikazuje se na popisu kanala, a drugi korisnici neće moći saznati da ste na njemu putem naredbe <em>WHOIS</em> ni na sličan način. Ako je ovaj način rada uključen, samo će korisnici na istom kanalu znati da ste ondje.</p></qt>"

#: src/viewer/channeloptionsdialog.cpp:615
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt><p>These control the <em>mode</em> of the channel.  Only an operator can "
"change these.</p><p>An <b>I</b>nvite only channel means that people can only "
"join the channel if they are invited.  To invite someone, a channel operator "
"needs to issue the command <em>/invite nick</em> from within the channel.</"
"p></qt>"
msgstr "<qt><p>Ove mogućnosti određuju <em>način rada</em> kanala. Mijenjati ih može samo operator.</p><p>Na kanal <b>samo uz poziv</b> mogu se pridružiti samo pozvani korisnici. Da biste nekoga pozvali, operator kanala mora upotrijebiti naredbu <em>/invite nick</em> unutar kanala.</p></qt>"

#: src/viewer/channeloptionsdialog.cpp:617
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt><p>These control the <em>mode</em> of the channel.  Only an operator can "
"change these.</p><p>A <b>P</b>rivate channel is shown in a listing of all "
"channels, but the topic is not shown.  A user's <em>WHOIS</em> may or may "
"not show them as being in a private channel depending on the IRC server.</"
"p></qt>"
msgstr "<qt><p>Ove mogućnosti određuju <em>način rada</em> kanala. Mijenjati ih može samo operator.</p><p><b>Privatni</b> kanal prikazuje se na popisu kanala, ali se njegova tema ne prikazuje. Ovisno o IRC poslužitelju, naredba <em>WHOIS</em> može, ali i ne mora prikazati da je korisnik na privatnom kanalu.</p></qt>"

#: src/viewer/channeloptionsdialog.cpp:619
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt><p>These control the <em>mode</em> of the channel.  Only an operator can "
"change these.</p><p>A <b>M</b>oderated channel is one where only operators, "
"half-operators and those with voice can talk.</p></qt>"
msgstr "<qt><p>Ove mogućnosti određuju <em>način rada</em> kanala. Mijenjati ih može samo operator.</p><p>Na <b>moderiranom</b> kanalu mogu govoriti samo operatori, poluoperatori i korisnici s glasom.</p></qt>"

#: src/viewer/channeloptionsdialog.cpp:621
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt><p>These control the <em>mode</em> of the channel.  Only an operator can "
"change these.</p><p>A protected channel requires users to enter a password "
"in order to join.</p></qt>"
msgstr "<qt><p>Ove mogućnosti određuju <em>način rada</em> kanala. Mijenjati ih može samo operator.</p><p>Za pridruživanje zaštićenom kanalu korisnici moraju unijeti lozinku.</p></qt>"

#: src/viewer/channeloptionsdialog.cpp:623
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt><p>These control the <em>mode</em> of the channel.  Only an operator can "
"change these.</p><p>A channel that has a user <b>L</b>imit means that only "
"that many users can be in the channel at any one time.  Some channels have a "
"bot that sits in the channel and changes this automatically depending on how "
"busy the channel is.</p></qt>"
msgstr "<qt><p>Ove mogućnosti određuju <em>način rada</em> kanala. Mijenjati ih može samo operator.</p><p>Ograničenje broja korisnika <b>L</b> znači da na kanalu istodobno može biti najviše navedeni broj korisnika. Neki kanali imaju bota koji automatski mijenja ograničenje ovisno o opterećenosti kanala.</p></qt>"

